utton></span></div><div class="toggle-field-with-info"><label class="toggle-field"><input type="checkbox" checked=""><span>Show alignment guides</span></label><span class="info-tip"><button type="button" class="info-button" aria-label="Show alignment guides information" aria-describedby=":r4f:"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></span></div><label class="field">Alignment tolerance<span class="number-input-with-unit"><input id=":r4g:" aria-label="Alignment tolerance (in)" inputmode="decimal" value="1"><select class="inline-unit-select" aria-label="Alignment tolerance (in) unit"><option value="in">in</option><option value="cm">cm</option></select></span></label><div class="toggle-field-with-info"><label class="toggle-field"><input type="checkbox"><span>Wall edge buffer</span></label><span class="info-tip"><button type="button" class="info-button" aria-label="Wall edge buffer information" aria-describedby=":r4i:"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></span></div><label class="field">Wall edge buffer gap<span class="number-input-with-unit"><input id=":r4j:" aria-label="Wall edge buffer gap (in)" disabled="" inputmode="decimal" value="2"><select class="inline-unit-select" aria-label="Wall edge buffer gap (in) unit"><option value="in">in</option><option value="cm">cm</option></select></span></label><div class="toggle-field-with-info"><label class="toggle-field"><input type="checkbox